Additionally, the function currently checks the total number of fields in the resulting TypedDict to determine whether to return a `Dict` instead. This approach may not be optimal, as the resulting TypedDict may still be too complex even if the total number of fields is within the `max_typed_dict_size` limit. We can modify the function to also consider the complexity of the field types when making this decision.

